steps.prompt:
Write a short story for a vertical video (9:16) about: {input}

Give it a title of at most 60 characters and between 3 and 8 scenes. For each scene give:
- narration: 1 to 3 sentences spoken aloud, at least 30 characters and at most 300 characters, plain words with no digits or abbreviations;
- caption: a short on-screen line of at most 60 characters, with no very long words;
- image_prompt: a vivid, concrete description of one portrait (9:16) picture for the scene, at most 500 characters. Repeat the look of the characters and the setting in every image_prompt so the pictures stay consistent;
- motion: one of zoom-in, zoom-out, pan-left, pan-right, none.
